============================
KEYBOARD ACTIONS IN PLAYWRIGHT
============================

WHAT ARE KEYBOARD ACTIONS?
--------------------------

Keyboard actions simulate user typing
and pressing keys.

Examples:

✔ Enter
✔ Tab
✔ Escape
✔ Ctrl+A
✔ Ctrl+C
✔ Ctrl+V

--------------------------------------------------

1. TYPE TEXT
------------

Method:

fill()

Example:

await page
.locator('#username')
.fill('Kirti');

--------------------------------------------------

2. PRESS A KEY
--------------

Syntax:

await page.keyboard.press('Key');

Example:

await page.keyboard.press('Enter');

--------------------------------------------------

COMMON KEYS
-----------

Enter

await page.keyboard.press('Enter');

----------------------

Tab

await page.keyboard.press('Tab');

----------------------

Escape

await page.keyboard.press('Escape');

----------------------

Arrow Down

await page.keyboard.press('ArrowDown');

----------------------

Arrow Up

await page.keyboard.press('ArrowUp');

--------------------------------------------------

3. KEY COMBINATIONS
-------------------

Ctrl + A

Select all text.

await page.keyboard.press(
    'Control+A'
);

--------------------------------------------------

Ctrl + C

Copy text.

await page.keyboard.press(
    'Control+C'
);

--------------------------------------------------

Ctrl + V

Paste text.

await page.keyboard.press(
    'Control+V'
);

--------------------------------------------------

Ctrl + X

Cut text.

await page.keyboard.press(
    'Control+X'
);

--------------------------------------------------

4. TYPE USING KEYBOARD
----------------------

await page.keyboard.type(
    'Hello World'
);

--------------------------------------------------

5. PRESS SEQUENTIAL KEYS
------------------------

await page.keyboard.press('Tab');

await page.keyboard.press('Enter');

--------------------------------------------------

REAL PROJECT EXAMPLES
---------------------

Search Box

await page
.locator('#search')
.fill('Playwright');

await page.keyboard.press(
    'Enter'
);

--------------------------------------------------

Move Between Fields

await page.keyboard.press(
    'Tab'
);

--------------------------------------------------

Close Popup

await page.keyboard.press(
    'Escape'
);

